[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0439","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0439.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1015","title":"Snes9x 1.37 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Snes9x 1.37 版本在安装为 setuid root 时存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向程序传递超长命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Snes9x 1.37 及更早版本，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1015"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 Snes9x 至 1.38 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，立即移除 Snes9x 的 setuid root 权限位（执行 chmod u-s /usr/local/bin/snes9x），避免本地用户通过命令行参数缓冲区溢出提权至 root。建议始终以普通用户身份运行模拟器，勿赋予 SUID 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-10/0107.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3437","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21120","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1015.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1015","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1015.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1015.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4mrr-j6hj-j39r/GHSA-4mrr-j6hj-j39r.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1015.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a22567c6-2f38-451d-a593-e00f0be98935.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0439.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0548","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0548.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1460","title":"PostNuke 0.62-0.64 article.php SQL注入漏洞","description":"PostNuke 0.62至0.64版本的article.php文件中存在SQL注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向user参数注入恶意SQL语句绕过身份认证机制，未经授权即可登录系统后台。该漏洞影响PostNuke 0.62、0.63及0.64版本，攻击者无需任何前置认证条件，仅需构造特制的HTTP请求即可利用，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。目前官方已发布修复版本，建议用户升级至最新版。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1460"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:19Z","remediation":"升级 PostNuke 至 0.65 或更高版本（该版本修复了 article.php 中 user 参数未过滤导致的 SQL 注入漏洞）。由于 PostNuke 项目已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 CMS 系统（如 WordPress 或 Drupal）。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层面（如 .htaccess 或 Nginx 规则）拦截包含 article.php?save=1 且 user 参数含单引号或 base64 编码特征的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-10/0088.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-10/0091.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/921547","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3435","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7280","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21119","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1460.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1460","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1460.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1460.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hp48-5ppw-8mm6/GHSA-hp48-5ppw-8mm6.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1460.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1492.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--be94e065-65af-4812-98f9-6decbb9fe5cf.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0548.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0505","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0505.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1287","title":"Ipswitch IMail Web Calendar 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 7.04 及更早版本中的 Web Calendar 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长 HTTP GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统，造成敏感信息泄露、系统破坏或进一步横向移动。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1287"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:58Z","remediation":"升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 7.04 之后的版本，该漏洞在 Web Calendar 组件中通过超长 HTTP GET 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Exchange、Postfix 等），并在防火墙层面限制对 Web Calendar 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-10/0083.html","http://www.ipswitch.com/Support/IMail/news.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3431","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22458","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1287.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1287","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1287.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1287.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rvpj-5wcp-7vw8/GHSA-rvpj-5wcp-7vw8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1287.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bd644952-e781-4054-a8dc-9cfd8fea0bc6.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0505.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0399","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0399.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1278","title":"Zope Web 应用服务器安全绕过漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.4 及更早版本存在安全绕过漏洞，其 DTML 模板引擎中的 dtml-var 标签 fmt 属性可被部分可信用户利用，通过访问该属性绕过安全控制并调用原本受限的方法。攻击者需具备一定权限以注入或修改 DTML 模板，进而执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响基于 Zope 框架构建的 Web 应用，可能导致敏感数据泄露或权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1278"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:57Z","remediation":"升级到 Zope 2.2.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 dtml-var 标签 fmt 属性导致的权限绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Zope 配置中禁用 dtml-var 标签的 fmt 属性访问，或通过反向代理限制对受影响方法的访问，仅允许完全受信任的用户调用相关方法。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-080.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-115.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3425","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1278.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1278","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1278.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e90b2f048f8d5dc2c03ffbfc9a042a055738ffe6/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1278.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mf74-w5x5-fpfg/GHSA-mf74-w5x5-fpfg.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1278.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1278.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1278.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--52ca8790-4271-47ce-8815-8042be6ac5a7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0399.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0376","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0376.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1227","title":"Zope Zope 安全控制绕过漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.4 及之前版本存在安全控制绕过漏洞，部分受信任用户可通过 dtml-var 标签的 fmt 属性访问受保护的方法，绕过安全控制机制。该漏洞影响 Zope 2.2.4 之前的所有版本，攻击者需具备部分受信任用户权限，通过构造特定的 dtml-var 标签并利用 fmt 属性调用受限方法，从而绕过安全控制访问受限资源或执行未授权操作。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH），影响机密性、完整性和可用性，Zope 官方已在 2.2.4 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1227"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:51Z","remediation":"升级Zope到最新稳定版本（如3.0.x或以上），并修改dtml-var配置中禁用fmt属性访问；设置web应用防火墙规则，严格限制对dtml标签的访问权限；实施强制认证和权限控制，阻止部分可信用户执行安全绕过操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-080.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-072.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-115.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3425","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7271","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1227.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1227","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1227.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1227.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fp27-q2r7-f723/GHSA-fp27-q2r7-f723.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1227.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1227.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1227.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d21a6470-b1f0-47b8-a497-f929c7c85fab.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0376.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0370","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0370.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1147","title":"util-linux /bin/login PAM 实现密码凭证泄露漏洞","description":"util-linux 包 2.11 之前版本中 /bin/login 的 PAM 实现存在密码条目重写漏洞。当使用 pam_limits 等特定 PAM 模块时，多次 PAM 调用之间密码条目可能被错误重写，导致一个用户的凭证泄露给另一个用户。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞获取其他用户的登录凭据，从而提升权限至受影响账户级别。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限并触发特定 PAM 调用序列，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1147"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:40Z","remediation":"升级 util-linux 软件包至 2.11 及以上版本。Red Hat Linux 用户应安装 RHSA-2001:132 提供的更新包（util-linux-2.11-2.i386.rpm），Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2001:084 对应更新。旧版 /bin/login 的 PAM 实现在连续调用 PAM 模块（如 pam_limits）时会错误复用前一次认证的密码凭据，升级后可消除此跨用户凭据泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-009.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7266.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-084.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_034_shadow_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-132.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/219175","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3415","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d056d8ae56f5d770f04fc59fa77c6fef447db4a1/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1147","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1147.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d927d63ee32587ef80d9e763226701b1dc32c67d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1147.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hc7f-gvfc-9wwx/GHSA-hc7f-gvfc-9wwx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1147.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-084.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--73c21556-9024-40f8-b62b-508e1e78fa73.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1147.json","https://github.com/dmc5179/rhsa-tools/blob/677b19c223fe2771414f7b2fc89b4a4f39d25719/cvrfs/RHSA-2001:132.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0370.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0466","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0466.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1127","title":"Progress Software Progress Database 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Progress Database 8.3D 和 9.1C 版本中存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞，漏洞存在于 _proapsv、_mprosrv、_mprshut、orarx、sqlcpp、_probrkr、_sqlschema 和 _sqldump 等多个组件中。本地攻击者可通过向受影响组件提交特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而以数据库进程权限执行任意代码。攻击条件要求攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1127"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:38Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Progress OpenEdge 12.8 或更高版本（当前最新 LTS 版本为 12.8，创新版本为 13.0），该漏洞影响 Progress Database 8.3D 和 9.1C，已超过 20 年未获安全支持。如无法升级，应限制本地用户对受影响二进制文件（_proapsv、_mprosrv、sqlcpp 等）的执行权限，仅授权可信用户访问数据库服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/218833","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3404","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7236","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21359","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1127.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1127","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1127.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1127.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-chc5-c252-g678/GHSA-chc5-c252-g678.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1127.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1127.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--91304a29-eeda-4ea0-9995-d6f659c91269.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0466.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0301","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0301.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0670","title":"多种 BSD 操作系统 lpd 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"多种 BSD 系操作系统的行打印守护进程（lpd/in.lpd）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含过长文件名的未完成打印作业，随后请求显示打印队列触发内存溢出，进而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 4.3 及更早版本、NetBSD 1.5.1 及更早版本、OpenBSD 2.9 及更早版本、BSD/OS 4.1 及更早版本等多个发行版，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者只需在网络可达目标主机的 TCP/515 端口即可发起利用，无需任何凭据。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0670"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:43Z","remediation":"升级受影响系统到最新补丁版本：NetBSD 升级至 1.5 分支 2001-09-30 后的版本并重新编译安装 /usr/sbin/lpd；OpenBSD 升级至 2.9 或应用 2.8 errata 032 补丁；FreeBSD 升级至 4.2 以后的稳定版本。如暂时无法升级，若不需打印服务应立即停止 lpd 进程，并通过 /etc/hosts.lpd 限制仅允许可信主机访问，禁止任意来源连接 515 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-30.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/274043","http://www.openbsd.com/errata28.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-147.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3252","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise94.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7046","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3a2f85f8ac60847cbc2b69c575be49a8e5667923/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0670.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0670","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/80b9e46bc035d31d1e13fdb38c5f781e8a013488/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0670.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3249236c34411e31ff9cfd40b20136dbc5077a03/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0670.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/25ad427cb260813264acc83dfac643f53a339579/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-v42x-vp33-82v3/GHSA-v42x-vp33-82v3.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/lpd_bsd_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0670.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--00518187-019d-4f93-8e63-4392f36ce23c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0301.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0308","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0731","title":"Apache HTTP Server 目录索引信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.20 在启用 Multiviews 选项时存在目录索引信息泄露漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送包含 \"M=D\" 查询字符串的 URL 请求，绕过默认索引页面直接获取目录列表内容，导致服务器目录结构和文件信息泄露。该漏洞影响启用 Multiviews 选项的 Apache 1.3.20 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），主要影响机密性。攻击者只需构造包含 \"M=D\" 参数的 HTTP 请求即可绕过索引页面直接列出目录内容，获取敏感文件列表信息。Apache 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或禁用 Multiviews 选项。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0731"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:51Z","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 1.3.21 或更高版本（已修复该漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，请在 httpd.conf 中将 Options Indexes FollowSymLinks MultiViews 修改为 Options FollowSymLinks（移除 Indexes 和 MultiViews），或在目录级配置添加 <Directory /> Options -Indexes -MultiViews </Directory> 禁用目录索引与多视图功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2001:077","http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/01-10-05#security","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-126.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-164.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/20010709214744.A28765%40brasscannon.net","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3009","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8275","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5f9c22f9c28adbd9f00556059edc7b03a5d5bb71d4bb80257c0d34e4%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3b4fe4a67f69885855126110e1e3f2fb2728e%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21002","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0731.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0731","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2001/CVE-2001-0731.rules","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0731.md","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/httpd-vulnerabilities/blob/b71e143e670cd0a24ad5402f3d46c0ba20429842/cves/CVE-2001-0731.yml","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1519.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0731.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jjrq-qfvr-fggw/GHSA-jjrq-qfvr-fggw.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/apache_dir_listing.nasl","https://github.com/GuangrenYu/WangYi/blob/7b722603e4edd5477bcf5e43a23d80ac3a43aaa5/poc_kb/custom/2001/CVE-2001-0731.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0475","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0475.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1170","title":"AmTote International Homebet 日志文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"AmTote International 的 Homebet 在线投注系统将包含用户账户和 PIN 码的敏感日志文件 homebet.log 存放在 Web 根目录下的 homebet/ 虚拟子目录中，且未设置任何访问控制或认证机制。远程攻击者只需通过 HTTP 直接访问该日志文件的 URL 即可获取所有用户的账户凭证信息，进而利用窃取的凭证进行未授权投注或资金操作。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需任何身份认证即可远程利用，影响范围涵盖所有部署了该版本的 Homebet 系统的服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1170"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:43Z","remediation":"将 homebet.log 文件移出 Web 可访问目录（如移至 /var/log/homebet/），并在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中添加对 /homebet/ 目录的访问控制规则，仅允许授权 IP 访问。同时设置日志文件权限为 600，仅允许应用进程读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-09/0235.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3370","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7186","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21115","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1170.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1170","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1170.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1170.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fv9m-q7gf-pc2v/GHSA-fv9m-q7gf-pc2v.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3370/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1170.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--126e1b48-c6ea-4317-8b4e-d04d3c14f5f2.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0475.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0475.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0500","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1383","title":"RedHat setserial Initscript 可预测临时文件漏洞","description":"setserial 2.17-4 及更早版本中的 initscript 初始化脚本使用可预测的临时文件名创建临时文件，本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击（symlink attack）在临时文件创建前于目标路径放置恶意符号链接，从而劫持临时文件指向系统关键文件，实现覆盖或破坏任意文件。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高（需本地访问权限且依赖文件创建时序），但一旦利用成功可导致目标系统机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。受影响的系统包括使用 setserial 2.17-4 及更早版本的 Linux 发行版。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1383"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:09Z","remediation":"升级 setserial 至 2.17-5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 initscript 使用不可预测临时文件名的问题。如无法升级，可在 initscript 中手动将临时文件创建方式改为 `mktemp` 替代直接拼接 PID 的方式，或限制本地非信任用户登录系统作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-110.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7177.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3367","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1383.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1383","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1383.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1383.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vvxr-ff2c-jx65/GHSA-vvxr-ff2c-jx65.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1383.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f1d033d5-f34a-45cb-9019-23ce9bba17cb.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/74384c0908702bccef653ea01534b2305b3a5ca4/2001.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1383.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0109","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1034","title":"HylaFAX faxrm/faxalter 格式字符串本地代码执行漏洞","description":"Hylafax 传真软件在 FreeBSD 系统上存在格式化字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 faxrm 或 faxalter 命令的 -h hostname 参数中传入特制的格式化字符串标识符，触发格式化字符串漏洞，导致攻击者能够以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行 Hylafax 的 FreeBSD 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议用户升级到已修复版本或限制本地用户对受影响命令的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1034"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-09-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:27Z","remediation":"升级 Hylafax 到 4.1.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复 faxrm 和 faxalter 中 -h 参数的格式化字符串问题。FreeBSD 用户可通过 ports 更新：`portsupgrade print/hylafax` 或重新编译安装。Debian 用户升级至 1:4.1.1-1.1（对应 DSA-148）。如无法立即升级，应限制本地不可信用户对 faxrm 和 faxalter 命令的执行权限，仅允许受信任的管理员使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/215984","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3357","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7164","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1034","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1034.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1034.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g7gq-5686-jw88/GHSA-g7gq-5686-jw88.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-055.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-148.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1034.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b0d891c6-0102-4c75-8987-941f621d9814.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0441","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0441.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1029","title":"FreeBSD OpenSSH 本地权限文件读取漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 4.4 及更早版本中 OpenSSH 所调用的 libutil 库存在权限检查绕过漏洞。当系统读取版权文件（copyright）和欢迎文件（welcome）时，该库在验证文件读取权限前未正确丢弃特权，导致本地攻击者可通过指定替代的版权或欢迎文件路径，绕过原有的权限检查机制，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 4.3/4.4 系统，攻击者需拥有本地用户权限，利用难度较低，可导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1029"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:26Z","remediation":"升级到 FreeBSD 4.5 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可限制本地用户对 /etc/login.conf 及相关欢迎/版权文件的写入权限，并移除 setuid 权限位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-09/0173.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6073","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8697","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21114","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1029.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1029","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1029.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1029.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rc87-8mcw-q34j/GHSA-rc87-8mcw-q34j.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1029.md","https://github.com/sdnewhop/grinder/blob/7432531e4a5a4ce3cc8224ac852188ef1d18432d/samples/052019-dicom-all/csv/vulnerability.csv","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openssh_uselogin_environment.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_200_300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0441.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0312","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0312.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0706","title":"Maximum Rumpus FTP Server 堆栈溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Maxum Rumpus FTP Server 1.3.x 及 2.0.3 开发版及更早版本存在栈溢出拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可通过发送包含大量子目录参数的 MKD/MKDIR 命令触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致 FTP 服务进程崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞属于本地/相邻网络攻击（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需认证（Au:N），仅影响可用性（A:P），CVSS 2.1 评为低危。影响范围为运行受影响版本 Rumpus FTP Server 的服务器，攻击者需具备本地或相邻网络访问权限且拥有创建目录权限即可利用。建议升级至 2.0.4 或更高版本修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0706"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Maxum Rumpus FTP Server 至 2.0.4 或更高版本（官网 maxum.com 提供更新）。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制 FTP 服务仅对受信 IP 开放，并禁用匿名 mkdir 权限作为临时缓解措施。建议同时监控 FTP 日志中异常 mkdir 请求，及时阻断异常 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/190932","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2864","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6699","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20922","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0706.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0706","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0706.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0706.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cccc-x5r4-7h2q/GHSA-cccc-x5r4-7h2q.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0706.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0706.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ea146eae-b320-4f7e-b3f5-4c0706ced76a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0312.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0309","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0705","title":"1C Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 任意文件泄露漏洞","description":"1C: Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 存在目录遍历漏洞。当攻击者向 Web 服务器发送包含 \"dot dot\" 序列的模板参数 URL 时，应用程序的 tradecli.dll 文件未能正确验证用户输入，导致攻击者能够访问 Web 服务器上的任意文件。这种漏洞影响 Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 版本，是一个经典的 Web 应用安全缺陷。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程执行攻击，通过精心构造的 URL 访问敏感文件，如系统配置文件、数据库连接字符串甚至是操作系统密码表等，威胁到整个服务器的安全。由于该漏洞仅影响信息的机密性，没有直接影响信息的完整性和可用性，因此 CVSS 评分仅为 5.0，反映出其属于低危信息泄露类漏洞，已经成为 Web 安全中的常见问题，该问题一直持续到如今都未能完全得到有效解决。(54字)","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0705"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48Z","remediation":"建议升级至 1C: Arcadia Internet Store 2.0 或更高版本（厂商已停止 1.0 版本支持）。若无法升级，建议在 Web 服务器层面配置 WAF 规则拦截包含 `../`、`..\\\\` 等目录遍历序列的请求，同时限制 Web 服务器进程对敏感目录的读取权限，并在防火墙层面限制对 tradecli.dll 接口的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192651","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2902","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6737","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20947","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0705.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f